From: Salty <99386653+PjSalty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:49:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] playstate: keep Transcode while the device has a live
 transcode

Intent: ValidatePlayMethod turns a reported Transcode into DirectPlay
when no transcoding job carries the reported PlaySessionId. A web
stream change (burned-in subtitle, quality, audio track) stops the old
job and reports progress with the new PlaySessionId before the new job
has registered, so the session was stored as DirectPlay, and the
server's progress timer kept replaying that report, while
TranscodingInfo showed a live NVENC transcode. The downgrade now also
requires that no session of the reporting device carries
TranscodingInfo. The device's running job sets that info, and a
non-transcode report or a stop clears it, so a real switch to direct
play still reads DirectPlay.
Drop when: upstream validates against the device's jobs, or the web
client reports only after the new job has started.

Patch: 0025
---
 Jellyfin.Api/Controllers/PlaystateController.cs | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Jellyfin.Api/Controllers/PlaystateController.cs b/Jellyfin.Api/Controllers/PlaystateController.cs
index 4ff1eef..c6178a3 100644
--- a/Jellyfin.Api/Controllers/PlaystateController.cs
+++ b/Jellyfin.Api/Controllers/PlaystateController.cs
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 using System;
 using System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations;
 using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;
+using System.Linq;
 using System.Threading.Tasks;
 using Jellyfin.Api.Extensions;
 using Jellyfin.Api.Helpers;
@@ -529,7 +530,7 @@ public class PlaystateController : BaseJellyfinApiController
         if (method == PlayMethod.Transcode)
         {
             var job = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(playSessionId) ? null : _transcodeManager.GetTranscodingJob(playSessionId);
-            if (job is null)
+            if (job is null && !DeviceIsTranscoding())
             {
                 return PlayMethod.DirectPlay;
             }
@@ -537,4 +538,13 @@ public class PlaystateController : BaseJellyfinApiController
 
         return method;
     }
+
+    // A stream change reports the new PlaySessionId before its job registers.
+    private bool DeviceIsTranscoding()
+    {
+        var deviceId = User.GetDeviceId();
+        return !string.IsNullOrEmpty(deviceId)
+            && _sessionManager.Sessions.Any(s => s.TranscodingInfo is not null
+                && string.Equals(s.DeviceId, deviceId, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase));
+    }
 }
